<h2 class="doc-h2">Sides</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A context menu has no side: it opens where the pointer was, and the compiler only keeps it on
    screen. That is the one structural difference from a dropdown, and why this component has no
    <code>Align</code> or <code>Side</code> to set.
</p>
